# DMGAssist list: Preservation Evoker damage between heals (learned from Method's guide, patch 12.1.5)
# Written by DMGAssist, not SimulationCraft. Fire Breath on cooldown, Deep Breath on 2+ targets, Disintegrate
# (mana via Energy Loop), Living Flame with Essence Burst. Healing stays the player's call.
actions.precombat=snapshot_stats
actions=fire_breath
actions+=/deep_breath,if=active_enemies>=2
actions+=/living_flame,if=buff.essence_burst.up
actions+=/disintegrate
actions+=/living_flame
